---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---
<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy" draft={true}>
  <p><strong>Effective date:</strong> TBD<br /><strong>Last updated:</strong> July 2026</p>

  <h2>1. What We Collect</h2>
  <p>When you submit a review, we collect:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Review content:</strong> Company name, tenure range, headline answer, dimension ratings, optional comment, and optional identity lens tags.</li>
    <li><strong>Org level:</strong> Your self-reported organizational level (e.g., individual contributor, manager).</li>
    <li><strong>Email address (optional):</strong> Only if you choose to provide one, for correction or removal requests only.</li>
    <li><strong>Metro area:</strong> The metro area you associate with your experience at the company.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>When you join our waitlist, we collect your email address.</p>

  <h2>2. What We Do NOT Collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Work email addresses for verification</li>
    <li>SSO or single sign-on credentials</li>
    <li>GPS location or precise geolocation</li>
    <li>Employer-verifiable information (exact hire/leave dates, department names, employee IDs)</li>
    <li>Any information that could directly identify you as the reviewer</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Review data</strong> is aggregated into company-level scores displayed on the Service. Individual reviews are never attributed to a specific person.</li>
    <li><strong>Identity lens tags</strong> are used to compute lens-specific aggregate scores. They are only displayed when enough reviews exist for that lens at that company to protect anonymity.</li>
    <li><strong>Email addresses</strong> are used solely to process correction or removal requests. They are never published, sold, or shared with third parties.</li>
    <li><strong>Waitlist emails</strong> are used to send product updates. You can unsubscribe at any time.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Data Storage</h2>
  <p>
    Review submissions are processed through Netlify Forms and stored in our moderation queue. Approved reviews are added to our aggregated dataset. We do not maintain individual review records beyond what is needed for moderation and aggregation.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Data Sharing</h2>
  <p>
    We do not sell, rent, or share personal data with third parties. Aggregated, anonymized score data may be referenced in public reporting or research, but never in a way that could identify individual reviewers.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Correction:</strong> If you provided an email, you can request correction of your review by contacting us.</li>
    <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> You can request removal of your review by contacting us from the email you provided during submission.</li>
    <li><strong>Waitlist removal:</strong> Email <strong>support@belongary.com</strong> to be removed from the waitlist.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>7. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
  <p>
    Belongary does not use tracking cookies, analytics pixels, or third-party advertising scripts. We may use essential cookies for basic site functionality (e.g., form submission state).
  </p>

  <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>
    Belongary is not intended for use by anyone under the age of 18. We do not knowingly collect information from minors.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this Privacy Policy as needed. Changes will be reflected in the "Last updated" date above.
  </p>

  <h2>10. Contact</h2>
  <p>Privacy questions? Email <strong>privacy@belongary.com</strong>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
